WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:04.971 line:0%
-♪ "Wheel of Opinions" ♪

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.039 line:0%
-Let's start
"Wheel of Opinions."

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:12.645 line:0%
Here we go.
[ Beeping ]

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:16.382 line:0%
Oh! Gyms reopening.
What's your thoughts?

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:19.885 line:0%
-Oh, my God. Thank God.
Where do I take my roid rage?

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.322 line:0%
I get roid rage when I'm doing
crunches in the house.

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:27.693 line:0%
I will say, my overall opinion
about everything reopening,

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:30.029 line:0%
like our governor --
I'm in California,

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:32.832 line:0%
and he's very safe.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:36.569 line:0%
So he says, "We're starting our
gradual Phase 1 opening,"

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.770 line:0%
and I'm like, "Oh, great!"

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:41.641 line:0%
He's like, "So,
it's gonna be rock quarries,

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:45.311 line:0%
caterpillar sanctuaries,

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.713 line:0%
and then maybe
in a couple years,

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.114 line:0%
gyms, restaurants.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.050 line:0%
But gyms are -- I don't know,

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.353 line:0%
because they're sort of gross.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.620 line:0%
I haven't been to one
in five years.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:55.755 line:0%
They could have closed
five years ago.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:56.756 line:0%
I don't even know.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:01:01.560 line:0%
LA Fitness, Equinox.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.029 line:0%
I don't mind not seeing
old guys drying

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:05.397 line:0%
their crotch with a blow-dryer.

00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:07.400 line:0%
[ Imitates blow-dryer humming ]

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.368 line:0%
"Hey! You see the Rams
game last --"

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:11.871 line:0%
[ Imitates blow-dryer humming ]

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:15.008 line:0%
Embarrassed. My God.
What's happening?

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.776 line:0%
Alright, spin it again.
[ Beeping ]

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:22.382 line:0%
-Your topic now is...
-[ Imitates beeping ]

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:27.720 line:0%
-Oh! Murder hornets.
Murder hornets exist.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.924 line:0%
-Murder hornets, man.
Let me tell you something.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.493 line:0%
Regular hornets
are no day at the beach.

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.262 line:0%
All hornets suck.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:40.466 line:0%
No one's ever like, "I wish we
had the good hornets here."

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:44.637 line:0%
Hornets are the worst
bug that -- Hornets.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:47.640 line:0%
Yeah, I don't even like to be
around the Charlotte Hornets.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.542 line:0%
-Let's do our final topic.
Are you ready?

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:53.245 line:0%
-[ Imitates beeping ]
[ Beeping ]

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:56.749 line:0%
-Your topic is...Mike Tyson
comeback.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:59.586 line:0%
Did you see this?
-This is real. Mike Tyson.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:03.456 line:0%
He's on that heavy bag.
-We both did that.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.458 line:0%
That's how we fight.
Imagine if we fought each other.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.094 line:0%
[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:13.666 line:0%
-It'd be like
Rock 'Em, Sock 'Em.

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:17.070 line:0%
-Oh, gosh.
-Tyson -- he is a little older.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.638 line:0%
And it's gonna air on
pay-per-view on TV Land.

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:23.242 line:0%
That's the only thing
I know for sure.

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:28.614 line:0%
I want him to fight --
I want Tyson to fight Fauci.

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:31.117 line:0%
Let's give him an easy one
right at the beginning.

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:33.452 line:0%
-Right? No, who is he --
We don't know who he's fighting?

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:35.020 line:0%
-Yeah, Dr. Fauci.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.956 line:0%
And then,
once he gets through him --

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:42.161 line:0%
which I wouldn't look past him,
'cause Fauci's, like, angry.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:43.462 line:0%
-Yeah, he's --

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:47.166 line:0%
-Fauci yesterday was like,
"Uh, it's unstoppable."

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:49.402 line:0%
I'm like, "I'm sorry.
What'd you say?

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:52.171 line:0%
"Coronavirus --
you know, it's unstoppable."

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:57.009 line:0%
I go, "I think this is
bad news, guys."

00:02:57.009 --> 00:02:59.111 line:0%
But Tyson --
I would like to see him,

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:01.714 line:0%
because I just thought
he was such

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.048 line:0%
a great fighter in the old days.

00:03:03.048 --> 00:03:06.585 line:0%
And he's so tough, and it's just
fun to watch him fight.

00:03:06.585 --> 00:03:08.587 line:0%
He looked --
I did see a video of him,

00:03:08.587 --> 00:03:10.389 line:0%
and he was whaling
this heavy bag.

00:03:10.389 --> 00:03:12.524 line:0%
And I go, "I wouldn't want
a piece of that guy.

00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:14.193 line:0%
He's too good."

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:15.594 line:0%
-Yeah, he's too good.
He's insane.

00:03:15.594 --> 00:03:18.130 line:0%
You know, he's done our show
before, and we did some bit.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.766 line:0%
And at the end of the bit,
he came over and he hugged me.

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:23.870 line:0%
And as we were hugging,
he put my ear in his mouth.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.673 line:0%
He bit my ear.
-That's hilarious.

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.975 line:0%
-So he did do it.
I can't fight Mike Tyson.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
-No, you just lay down.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.545 line:0%
-Yeah, I just go, "He did it."

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:35.114 line:0%
I got to maybe laugh
along with it or something.

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:39.352 line:0%
-Then you go, "We'll be back
with Kathryn Hahn."

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.754 line:0%
-David Spade,
we love hearing from you.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.722 line:0%
Thank you for playing
this game with us.

00:03:43.722 --> 00:03:47.092 line:0%
Spade, I love you, man.
I'll call you or whatever.

00:03:47.092 --> 00:03:48.828 line:0%
I'll text you or whatever.
-Whatever, buddy.

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.763 line:0%
I love to hear from you. Thanks.
-Bye, pal.

